{
  "_comment": [
    "Website presentation layer for the catalogue. Zoho Books is the source of truth for",
    "NAME, PRICE and DESCRIPTION - those come from the linked zoho_item_id and are never set here.",
    "This file only holds what Zoho does not know about: which items appear online, their",
    "category, collection tag, and their photos/video.",
    "",
    "Media order is exactly the carousel order. Video, when present, always shows first.",
    "",
    "display_name overrides the Zoho item name on the website (Zoho names are internal/SKU-ish).",
    "Leave display_name null to use the Zoho name verbatim.",
    "",
    "zoho_item_id: null means UNLINKED - the product still renders using fallback_price,",
    "but orders for it cannot post a line item to Zoho. Resolve these.",
    "",
    "active: false hides the product from the site entirely (skipped by build_catalog.py)",
    "while keeping its config here for later reactivation. Omit the field (or set true) to show it.",
    "",
    "specs.weight_g is a plain integer (grams) - it drives BOTH the displayed",
    "+/-Ng spec on the product page AND the real weight sent to EasyParcel for",
    "shipping rate quotes (api/product-weights.json, regenerated by build_catalog.py",
    "from this field - do not hand-edit that file, it will be overwritten)."
  ],
